1
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:20,080
Why did you bite it?

2
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:22,680
The bite marks will tell me everything.

3
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:25,880
A cat's bite

4
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:28,500
is completely different from a human's.

5
00:01:28,720 --> 00:01:30,680
And this is a cat's bite mark.

6
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:32,360
Is it Jinzi's?

7
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:33,880
This isn't Jinzi's.

8
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:36,000
It was done by a stray cat.

9
00:01:36,680 --> 00:01:38,680
You're wasting so much time on a fish bone.

10
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,410
Can you actually do this or not?

11
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:43,039
This is the art of detection.

12
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:48,080
You're just hungry, aren't you?

13
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,320
Smooth and soft.

14
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,160
No dust.

15
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,840
It also has

16
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:09,039
the smell of pet shampoo.

17
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,720
Is that Jinzi?

18
00:02:10,720 --> 00:02:12,050
It's domestic cat hair.

19
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,170
Jinzi has been here.

20
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:19,040
Then where is it now?

21
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:21,940
It won't stray far from a food source.

22
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,480
It must be nearby,

23
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:27,120
in a safe place.

24
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:33,730
Let's go.

25
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:43,440
Legend has it that Kongming lanterns originated in Pingle Ancient Town, Sichuan.

26
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:44,680
During the Three Kingdoms period,

27
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,880
Zhuge Liang was trapped here by Sima Yi.

28
00:02:47,480 --> 00:02:50,079
He had a brainwave and made this paper lantern,

29
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,000
wrote an SOS message on it,

30
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:53,880
and finally managed to be rescued.

31
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,640
To commemorate Zhuge Liang,

32
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:58,700
people named this paper lantern the Kongming lantern.

33
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,040
Releasing Kongming lanterns

34
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:02,080
has gradually become a festive custom

35
00:03:02,080 --> 00:03:04,740
for everyone to give blessings and make wishes.

36
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,680
Mr. Liu Ding.

37
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,560
We just got some news.

38
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,960
The Forestry Bureau didn't approve it.

39
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:10,360
We...

40
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:12,080
They are afraid we might cause a fire.

41
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:14,200
We can't release the Kongming lanterns anymore.

42
00:03:14,200 --> 00:03:16,260
Isn't everything already prepared?

43
00:03:16,280 --> 00:03:19,340
We are currently trying to figure out other solutions.

44
00:03:20,280 --> 00:03:20,440
Come on.

45
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,440
Rolling in three, two, one, action.

46
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,400
Water lanterns, also known as river lanterns,

47
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:28,060
are a traditional custom of the Chinese nation.

48
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:29,680
In the old days, Guangdong

49
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:33,280
often combined the release of lanterns with praying for a child.

50
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:36,280
Women in Suzhou and Hangzhou also release lanterns

51
00:03:36,280 --> 00:03:38,010
to compete on who makes the most

52
00:03:38,079 --> 00:03:39,480
and releases them the best.

53
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:40,320
Today,

54
00:03:40,320 --> 00:03:42,920
we will write our wishes in the water lanterns,

55
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,079
hoping everyone's wishes come true.

56
00:03:46,920 --> 00:03:49,800
So we just write our wishes on this paper

57
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,640
and put it in the water lantern, right?

58
00:03:51,640 --> 00:03:52,120
Yes.

59
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,320
Brother Xi,

60
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,079
