65
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:06,240
So fast.

66
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,080
That was fast.

67
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,090
I'm done too.

68
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,740
