83
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,200
Look at what I wrote.

84
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:45,120
I hope "The Legend of Huayue 2" breaks records

85
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:46,680
and rewrites the failure of the last season.

86
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,280
That's why

87
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:52,080
Brother Ye and Lili are indeed the chosen leading actor and actress.

88
