185
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:24,360
I...

186
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,360
Directors.

187
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,280
Director.

188
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:30,440
Calm down.

189
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,000
