197
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:46,690
Otherwise, I will definitely sue you.

198
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:47,280
Director.

199
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:48,040
Where is my assistant?

200
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:48,680
This is too scary.

201
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:49,600
Bring me my phone.

202
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,400
Director Zha.

203
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:53,480
Director Zha.

204
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,120
Director.

205
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:55,920
