00:27:14,600 --> 00:27:15,720
Miss, I'm Tong.

582
00:27:15,840 --> 00:27:16,840
Miss, I'm Wen Shuai.

583
00:27:16,840 --> 00:27:18,400
Hello, everyone.

584
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:19,480
Let's toast to the Miss again.

585
00:27:19,480 --> 00:27:20,320
Come on.

586
00:27:20,320 --> 00:27:22,280
Wishing you eternal beauty, Miss.

587
00:27:22,280 --> 00:27:23,000
Come on.

588
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:25,080
Cheers.

589
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:28,400
We've had our drinks.

590
00:27:28,400 --> 00:27:30,440
What about the matter you promised me earlier?

591
00:27:30,440 --> 00:27:32,200
The script of this short drama

592
00:27:32,200 --> 00:27:35,040
