593
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:38,480
The love and hate story between a queen and eight generals.

594
00:27:39,040 --> 00:27:40,840
I have everything set up.

595
00:27:41,080 --> 00:27:43,010
Just waiting for you to say action.

596
00:27:43,560 --> 00:27:45,420
The lead actor is Xu Yadan, right?

597
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:46,680
Sister,

598
00:27:46,720 --> 00:27:48,640
Xu Yadan really wants to join.

599
00:27:49,320 --> 00:27:50,640
But there is a problem.

600
00:27:51,120 --> 00:27:53,780
He won't be available for another eight months.

601
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:56,320
But there is good news.

602
00:27:56,320 --> 00:28:00,040
These guys are all very good actors.

603
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:02,000
Good acting, good looking,

604
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,880
