605
00:28:02,880 --> 00:28:04,880
Come, let me take a look.

606
00:28:06,920 --> 00:28:07,240
Touch me.

607
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:07,900
Touch mine.

608
00:28:08,040 --> 00:28:09,100
What are you doing?

609
00:28:10,040 --> 00:28:10,840
Stop it.

610
00:28:11,000 --> 00:28:11,560
Go away.

611
00:28:12,120 --> 00:28:12,800
Sister,

612
00:28:13,240 --> 00:28:14,280
