613
00:28:14,280 --> 00:28:15,760
Let me introduce him,

614
00:28:16,160 --> 00:28:17,720
Charlie Wang.

615
00:28:17,720 --> 00:28:18,560
Hello.

616
00:28:18,880 --> 00:28:21,440
Famous music producer Wu Qiming.

617
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:22,560
Wu Qiming,

618
00:28:22,720 --> 00:28:23,680
Jin Xi.

619
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:28,560
You're the one working with Jin Xi.

620
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:30,840
I've heard of it before.

621
00:28:30,840 --> 00:28:32,440
Sister, you invested in their show?

622
00:28:32,440 --> 00:28:33,000
Right?

623
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:34,480
But...

624
00:28:35,800 --> 00:28:38,920
As a pretty good director in the industry,

625
00:28:39,120 --> 00:28:39,980
let me tell you.

626
00:28:40,480 --> 00:28:41,280
Right now,

627
00:28:41,560 --> 00:28:43,280
the musical market

628
00:28:43,680 --> 00:28:45,240
