630
00:28:46,320 --> 00:28:46,920
Really?

631
00:28:46,920 --> 00:28:48,000
Of course, sister.

632
00:28:48,560 --> 00:28:50,680
We have to switch tracks.

633
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,960
Do you know what the future trend is?

634
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:54,560
Short dramas.

635
00:28:54,560 --> 00:28:55,280
Short dramas?

636
00:28:55,280 --> 00:28:56,240
Of course.

637
00:28:56,240 --> 00:28:58,640
The short drama track has great potential.

638
00:28:59,440 --> 00:29:02,560
If he did well in premium long dramas,

639
00:29:02,560 --> 00:29:04,290
