640
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:05,120
No.

641
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:06,440
Let me tell you,

642
00:29:06,440 --> 00:29:07,000
look.

643
00:29:07,360 --> 00:29:08,360
I heard

644
00:29:08,600 --> 00:29:09,920
his previous show

645
00:29:10,040 --> 00:29:11,700
