646
00:29:12,280 --> 00:29:12,840
Really?

647
00:29:12,840 --> 00:29:14,280
Both shows got rejected.

648
00:29:14,280 --> 00:29:14,880
Really?

649
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:15,560
Big gossip.

650
00:29:16,280 --> 00:29:17,080
Charlie Wang,

651
00:29:18,080 --> 00:29:18,960
didn't you say

652
00:29:19,440 --> 00:29:20,840
