653
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:21,920
That's not what happened.

654
00:29:21,920 --> 00:29:22,780
Let me tell you.

655
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:24,640
Things in our film and TV circle...

656
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:26,100
He doesn't know anything.

657
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:27,080
One month.

658
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:31,800
What one month?

659
00:29:31,800 --> 00:29:33,920
I'll put it on stage for you in a month.

660
00:29:34,320 --> 00:29:35,080
One month?

661
00:29:35,400 --> 00:29:36,800
One month is impossible.

662
00:29:37,840 --> 00:29:38,700
I guarantee you

663
00:29:38,840 --> 00:29:39,500
