665
00:29:40,560 --> 00:29:41,480
A double win.

666
00:29:42,120 --> 00:29:44,040
One month is not enough.

667
00:29:45,120 --> 00:29:46,200
In a month,

668
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:49,160
