669
00:29:59,400 --> 00:30:01,200
Now I can give Ning Jin an explanation.

670
00:30:01,200 --> 00:30:01,640
No.

671
00:30:01,720 --> 00:30:02,800
The performance is in a month.

672
00:30:02,800 --> 00:30:03,680
Are you trying to kill everyone?

673
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:04,600
How could I?

674
00:30:04,600 --> 00:30:05,560
I'm leaving now.

675
00:30:05,560 --> 00:30:07,020
We'll talk when I get back.

676
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:09,120
Mr. Heying, right?

677
00:30:13,120 --> 00:30:14,040
I've seen your plays.

678
00:30:14,040 --> 00:30:14,500
Really?

679
00:30:14,880 --> 00:30:15,560
Which one?

680
00:30:16,080 --> 00:30:17,480
Your acting is very good.

681
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:19,320
But I think

682
00:30:19,840 --> 00:30:21,720
